AVSG dataset annotations (scene graphs, attributes, validation judgments, and
accompanying documentation) are released for research purposes under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License
(CC BY-NC 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/,
with the following additional use restriction:

- The dataset and annotations may NOT be used for surveillance, biometric
  identification, or the identification or tracking of the individuals
  appearing in the source videos.

Notes:
- Video content is NOT distributed. Clips reference publicly available YouTube
  videos (ids + timestamps); anyone re-acquiring them must comply with YouTube's
  Terms of Service.
- Clip boundaries and captions derive from the LongVALE dataset (Geng et al.,
  CVPR 2025); users should additionally respect LongVALE's terms and cite it.
- Model predictions in predictions/ are outputs of the respective third-party
  models and are provided solely for reproducibility of the paper's evaluation.
